436	    /**
437	     * Caps the membership level of an owner about to be created so it cannot exceed one above the
438	     * current maximum membership level among the owner's existing household members. The owner is not
439	     * yet persisted, so {@link #activeHouseholdMembers(String)} returns exactly the members already on
440	     * file; each member's effective (already-capped) level is read via
441	     * {@link org.springframework.samples.petclinic.mapper.MembershipLevel#forOwner(Owner)}. When the
442	     * household has no existing member no ceiling applies and the cap is left unset, so the owner keeps
443	     * its fully-derived level.
444	     *
445	     * @param owner the normalized owner about to be created, with its {@code householdId} already set
446	     */
