636	     * Validates an owner's optional registration date. Registration date is optional, so a missing
637	     * value is accepted (the create later defaults it to the server date). When a value is supplied
638	     * it may not lie in the future: a date later than the server's current date is rejected with a
639	     * 400 whose {@code errors} array lists {@code registrationDate}.
640	     *
641	     * @param registrationDate the submitted registration date, or {@code null} when none was supplied
642	     * @throws InvalidOwnerFieldsException if a supplied date is later than the server date
643	     */
644	    private void validateRegistrationDate(LocalDate registrationDate) {
645	        if (registrationDate != null && registrationDate.isAfter(LocalDate.now())) {
